  message: "Superseded by WI-vusot, which has the same scope (axis_meta_keys.py parallel registry) but a broader title that explicitly covers BOTH Edge.meta AND Symbol.meta keys. WI-vusot fires once both ADR-0027 (framework_role) and ADR-0028 (framework_dispatch + call_construct) meta key spaces are populated post-Wave-5 framework dispatch landing. Hard isbefore edges WI-habut→WI-vusot and WI-kagik→WI-vusot enforce the dependency. Closing this item to dedupe the work stream."  # 38a4
